# The Vercel build only needs the Next.js app. These top-level directories are
# part of the repository but never imported by app code, and shipping them made
# the build's type check follow tests/ into desktop/, whose `threadlink`
# dependency is a local file: link that is not installed here.
#
# Patterns are anchored: an unanchored `supabase` would also drop lib/supabase/.
/tests
/desktop
/runtime
/supabase
/docs
/scripts
/.next
